+demonstrations at seed `0`, sample indices `0,1,2`. It disagrees in 19 cells with
+the canonical any-zero selector on seed `17`, sample index `7`, using the
+supported exact override `scene_profile=multiple_dot_shapes`.
+
+This is an explicitly assembled lesson with an override-generated query, not a
+measured failure rate for ordinary episodes. Fifteen ordinary draws across seeds
+`0` and `17` contained no multi-dot query, so the final allowed draw used the
+declared override. Every retained input passes `self_check`; none has literal
