+It also checks that exposing the retained multi-dot pair as a demonstration
+rejects the rival. Evidence: `checks/5553241d87bf/dot-count.json` and
+`checks/5553241d87bf/dot-count-command.json`.
+
+Recommended repair: include a visible multi-dot target before allowing a
+multi-dot query, or constrain query profiles to demonstrated behavior. Preserve
+literal-zero-copying coverage independently. No production source, canonical
+rule, approval, or existing finding disposition was changed. This probe covers
