+
+```sh
+WORK/.venv/bin/python review.py run --receipt checks/7d1e8744229a/palette-rank-command.json python3 -B generators/7d1e8744229a/workspace/palette_rank_probe.py --out ../checks/7d1e8744229a/palette-rank
+```
+
+The command exited 0. All 95 distinct intended/rival label executions used the
